[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l027","ordinal":157441,"en":"What a waist she has girded!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l028","ordinal":157442,"en":"Where did this toil-stricken bitch"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l029","ordinal":157443,"en":"Find such a husband?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l030","ordinal":157444,"en":"If one of these breaks free,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l031","ordinal":157445,"en":"It will surely eat us!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l032","ordinal":157446,"en":"Can anyone prosper who devises"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l033","ordinal":157447,"en":"Every kind of lawless deed?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l034","ordinal":157448,"en":"Can anyone prosper who gathers"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l035","ordinal":157449,"en":"And ties up fourteen tigers?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l036","ordinal":157450,"en":"She has worn down horses' flanks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l037","ordinal":157451,"en":"The wretched woman of consummate arts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l038","ordinal":157452,"en":"Flying about and traversing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b003:l039","ordinal":157453,"en":"The whole wide world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l001","ordinal":157454,"en":"Of Chürök's forty arts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l002","ordinal":157455,"en":"Which art can we know?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l003","ordinal":157456,"en":"Is one of these the mountain pass lying closed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l004","ordinal":157457,"en":"Or is it the wretched Chürök's husband"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l005","ordinal":157458,"en":"Who came from Beijing?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l006","ordinal":157459,"en":"We knew it from the beginning:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l007","ordinal":157460,"en":"A sidelong look was always in her eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l008","ordinal":157461,"en":"A crooked edge was always in her words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l009","ordinal":157462,"en":"Given the chance, Azhybay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l010","ordinal":157463,"en":"She was always ready to trip me!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l011","ordinal":157464,"en":"A slant was always in her eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l012","ordinal":157465,"en":"Perversity was always in her words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l013","ordinal":157466,"en":"When the moment suited this Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l014","ordinal":157467,"en":"She was ready to work her Tümönbay trick on you!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l015","ordinal":157468,"en":"Azhybay and Tümönbay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l016","ordinal":157469,"en":"Stood rigid, unable to walk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l017","ordinal":157470,"en":"Quarreling with one another:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l018","ordinal":157471,"en":"\"We must have come to experience"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l019","ordinal":157472,"en":"Torment like Judgment Day;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l020","ordinal":157473,"en":"We must have come to die"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l021","ordinal":157474,"en":"At the hands of maiden Chürök!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l022","ordinal":157475,"en":"When Chynkozho strikes with a roar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l023","ordinal":157476,"en":"Will he spare a soul?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l024","ordinal":157477,"en":"When fourteen tigers gather and maul us,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l025","ordinal":157478,"en":"Will they spare a soul?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l026","ordinal":157479,"en":"Chürök has raised"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l027","ordinal":157480,"en":"This calamitous turmoil;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l028","ordinal":157481,"en":"We have died before living out our lives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l029","ordinal":157482,"en":"And suffered disgrace from the infidels!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l030","ordinal":157483,"en":"When Azhybay and Tümönbay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l031","ordinal":157484,"en":"Saw those tigers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l032","ordinal":157485,"en":"The strength left their arms,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l033","ordinal":157486,"en":"And courage left their hearts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l034","ordinal":157487,"en":"Azhybay cowered against Tümönbay;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l035","ordinal":157488,"en":"From inside Azhybay's trousers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l036","ordinal":157489,"en":"His urine streamed out."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l037","ordinal":157490,"en":"Words deserted Tümönbay's mouth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1065:b005:l038","ordinal":157491,"en":"And the staring light deserted Azhybay's eyes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l001","ordinal":157492,"en":"Straining harder as they heaved,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l002","ordinal":157493,"en":"The fourteen tigers roared;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l003","ordinal":157494,"en":"From their terror,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l004","ordinal":157495,"en":"The men's beards trembled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l005","ordinal":157496,"en":"The fourteen tigers growled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l006","ordinal":157497,"en":"Azhybay's and Tümönbay's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l007","ordinal":157498,"en":"Beards quivered strand by strand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l008","ordinal":157499,"en":"Chürök moved toward the palace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l009","ordinal":157500,"en":"Pacing at an amble."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l010","ordinal":157501,"en":"With all recourse gone then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l011","ordinal":157502,"en":"Azhybay and Tümönbay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l012","ordinal":157503,"en":"Cowered close to Aychürök."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l013","ordinal":157504,"en":"The two had lost their senses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b003:l014","ordinal":157505,"en":"Their wits gone and faces distorted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l001","ordinal":157506,"en":"Here and there the two men"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l002","ordinal":157507,"en":"Went along vomiting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l003","ordinal":157508,"en":"When they drew near"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l004","ordinal":157509,"en":"Aychürök's palace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l005","ordinal":157510,"en":"Her guards were beyond counting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l006","ordinal":157511,"en":"And her watchmen more numerous still."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l007","ordinal":157512,"en":"Around the foot of that palace"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l008","ordinal":157513,"en":"Stood a grove of plane trees."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l009","ordinal":157514,"en":"When they entered that palace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l010","ordinal":157515,"en":"Appearing like Opol Mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l011","ordinal":157516,"en":"As stately as a prince's riding camel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l012","ordinal":157517,"en":"Azhybay and Tümönbay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l013","ordinal":157518,"en":"At that moment now saw"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b004:l014","ordinal":157519,"en":"The hero Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l001","ordinal":157520,"en":"Akun's daughter Chürök"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l002","ordinal":157521,"en":"Had an inexhaustible tale;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l003","ordinal":157522,"en":"Without showing him to any person,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l004","ordinal":157523,"en":"Aychürök had brought"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l005","ordinal":157524,"en":"The tiger, brave Semetey, by night"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l006","ordinal":157525,"en":"And hidden him away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l007","ordinal":157526,"en":"When they went in and looked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l008","ordinal":157527,"en":"Semetey, son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l009","ordinal":157528,"en":"Had a face like oiled wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l010","ordinal":157529,"en":"And eyes like twilight mist."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l011","ordinal":157530,"en":"He was as large as half a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l012","ordinal":157531,"en":"As though he would devour any attacker;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l013","ordinal":157532,"en":"His right shoulder was broad,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l014","ordinal":157533,"en":"A lion who could shatter the Oirats."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l015","ordinal":157534,"en":"His brow was like rugged foothills;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l016","ordinal":157535,"en":"If he caught Chynkozho and Toltoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l017","ordinal":157536,"en":"He looked certain to swallow them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l018","ordinal":157537,"en":"His brow was high, his menace strong;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l019","ordinal":157538,"en":"Like Khan Manas himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b006:l020","ordinal":157539,"en":"He would flatten any attacker!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l001","ordinal":157540,"en":"Semetey, left behind"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l002","ordinal":157541,"en":"By Manas who had gone to the next world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l003","ordinal":157542,"en":"Was himself an orphaned bridegroom;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l004","ordinal":157543,"en":"He had now come of age"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l005","ordinal":157544,"en":"And was seeking to take his wife."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l006","ordinal":157545,"en":"Azhybay recognized him;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l007","ordinal":157546,"en":"Running forward with folded hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l008","ordinal":157547,"en":"He offered his greeting:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l009","ordinal":157548,"en":"\"Peace upon peace be with you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l010","ordinal":157549,"en":"Our splendid bridegroom!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l011","ordinal":157550,"en":"We have kept hearing the news,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l012","ordinal":157551,"en":"'Surely the blood-taking bridegroom lives.'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l013","ordinal":157552,"en":"These are our words of greeting:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l014","ordinal":157553,"en":"Do they live safe and well,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l015","ordinal":157554,"en":"The inheritance your father left,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l016","ordinal":157555,"en":"Your people of the six Kyrgyz tribes?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l017","ordinal":157556,"en":"Argyn and Kyrgyz mingled together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l018","ordinal":157557,"en":"Are all of you safe?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l019","ordinal":157558,"en":"And your aged Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1066:b007:l020","ordinal":157559,"en":"Shield of the peoples of the world?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l001","ordinal":157560,"en":"My son, does it stand safe and sound,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l002","ordinal":157561,"en":"Your tethering line set up in Talas?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l003","ordinal":157562,"en":"And aged Chyyyrdy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l004","ordinal":157563,"en":"And dear lady Kanykey—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l005","ordinal":157564,"en":"Does she live safe and sound,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l006","ordinal":157565,"en":"Your mother who suffered torment?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l007","ordinal":157566,"en":"Is your divided people still there?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l008","ordinal":157567,"en":"And Bölökbay, who guarded"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l009","ordinal":157568,"en":"Manas's treasury and was"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l010","ordinal":157569,"en":"A friend to the giant Dөөтү—is he alive?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l011","ordinal":157570,"en":"Did you safely find"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l012","ordinal":157571,"en":"The remnant of the scattered people?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l013","ordinal":157572,"en":"Did you safely find"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l014","ordinal":157573,"en":"The descendants of Almambet and Chubak?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l015","ordinal":157574,"en":"Did you see within Talas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l016","ordinal":157575,"en":"Your fox like a gray hare?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l017","ordinal":157576,"en":"Did you take back without scattering any"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l018","ordinal":157577,"en":"Your property left by Manas?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l019","ordinal":157578,"en":"If we follow the words of tradition,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l020","ordinal":157579,"en":"If we ask those who know,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l021","ordinal":157580,"en":"We heard news of you from Bukhara."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l022","ordinal":157581,"en":"We have kept safe"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l023","ordinal":157582,"en":"Your wife, Aychürök."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l024","ordinal":157583,"en":"Because of where she had gone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l025","ordinal":157584,"en":"Because of your bride,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l026","ordinal":157585,"en":"A lamb's meat seemed a fur coat to us;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l027","ordinal":157586,"en":"We saw hell loom terribly great."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l028","ordinal":157587,"en":"Because of Aychürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l029","ordinal":157588,"en":"Embers sprang from the hearth;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l030","ordinal":157589,"en":"Demanding, 'Give us Aychürök,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l031","ordinal":157590,"en":"Mighty Chynkozho and Toltoy arose!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l032","ordinal":157591,"en":"Beginning his account with Chynkozho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l033","ordinal":157592,"en":"While he stood saying this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l034","ordinal":157593,"en":"The young prince Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l035","ordinal":157594,"en":"That dear lion, proud as a cock,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l036","ordinal":157595,"en":"Stirred and began to speak;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l037","ordinal":157596,"en":"The dear hero returned the greeting:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l038","ordinal":157597,"en":"\"The people are safe, the khan is safe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b003:l039","ordinal":157598,"en":"Lion Bakay too is safe;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l001","ordinal":157599,"en":"The land of Zhylygnduu and Keng-Kol is safe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l002","ordinal":157600,"en":"The happy Kyrgyz people are safe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l003","ordinal":157601,"en":"Kanykey and Chyyyrdy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l004","ordinal":157602,"en":"My two mothers, are safe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l005","ordinal":157603,"en":"Let us greet one another, elder in-law;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l006","ordinal":157604,"en":"You whom I have newly seen are safe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l007","ordinal":157605,"en":"Our fox that goes forth like poison,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l008","ordinal":157606,"en":"Our inheritance left by our father,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l009","ordinal":157607,"en":"Is lying safe and sound."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l010","ordinal":157608,"en":"We have come to act as intermediaries;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l011","ordinal":157609,"en":"Our intentions are pure."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l012","ordinal":157610,"en":"Do they live safe and sound,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l013","ordinal":157611,"en":"My two elder in-laws,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l014","ordinal":157612,"en":"Your Afghan people at Opol?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l015","ordinal":157613,"en":"Our influence reaches our Kozho;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l016","ordinal":157614,"en":"Do your Afghan people here"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l017","ordinal":157615,"en":"Remain undisturbed and safe?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l018","ordinal":157616,"en":"From atop the golden throne,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l019","ordinal":157617,"en":"Your gray-maned lion, sitting unmoved,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l020","ordinal":157618,"en":"Leaned forward and stretched out his hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l021","ordinal":157619,"en":"What else could Azhybay and Tümönbay do"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l022","ordinal":157620,"en":"But panic?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l023","ordinal":157621,"en":"Both stretched out their hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l024","ordinal":157622,"en":"Struck by God in their haste."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l025","ordinal":157623,"en":"Semetey, son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l026","ordinal":157624,"en":"Stretched his hand toward the two;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l027","ordinal":157625,"en":"When he grasped them both together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l028","ordinal":157626,"en":"They did not even fill his palm."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l029","ordinal":157627,"en":"\"Would a hero fail to take interest"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l030","ordinal":157628,"en":"In such feeble men?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l031","ordinal":157629,"en":"If two thousand weaklings like these"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l032","ordinal":157630,"en":"Came together as one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l033","ordinal":157631,"en":"Would my poor head be satisfied?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l034","ordinal":157632,"en":"Would Toltoy and Chynkozho fail"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l035","ordinal":157633,"en":"To heap humiliation upon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l036","ordinal":157634,"en":"Weak men like these"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l037","ordinal":157635,"en":"And shut them away?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l038","ordinal":157636,"en":"Your young champion, son of the blood-taker,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1067:b005:l039","ordinal":157637,"en":"Held both men's hands at once,"}]
